Package: DescriptiveStats
Title: Publication-Quality Descriptive Statistics Dashboard
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Tolera", "Keno", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "tolekeno@gmail.com")
Description: A modular Shiny dashboard for exploratory data analysis and
    publication-ready reporting of tabular data. Provides data upload
    (CSV/TSV/Excel), data preparation, descriptive statistics, distribution
    plots, group comparisons, correlation analysis, principal component
    analysis, linear regression with diagnostics, and data quality checks.
    All figures use journal-style colour palettes and can be exported at
    publication resolution.
